# Mechanism Kind end-to-end validation case
#
# Targets T2.1 (mechanism Kind in ERM) + T2.2 (mechanism scan pipeline).
# The question asks "how does ContinuationPrompt work?" which should:
#   1. extract a `mechanism` ERM Kind from "怎么实现"
#   2. resolve `ContinuationPrompt` as the target function
#   3. extractDecisionBlocks find its top-level branches
#   4. mechanism_scan emit EvidenceMechanism items per branch
#   5. answerPredicateWhitelist (T1.3) accept mechanism predicates so
#      they reach Ground Truth
#   6. final answer enumerates the actual strategies, not a generic
#      "it returns a prompt" hand-wave
#
# Expected substrings come from the canonical strategy list in
# reference_explorer_eval_methodology (T3 ground truth):
#   - function-boundary read guidance
#   - enumeration completeness push
#   - idle streak / idle termination
ID="df3"
NAME="ContinuationPrompt mechanism enumeration"
QUESTION="explorerEvaluator 的 ContinuationPrompt 是怎么实现的?有哪几种 push 策略?"
#
# EXPECT_CONTAINS substring set must catch semantic correctness, not
# just "file name appears somewhere in the output." Previous version
# (ContinuationPrompt + explorer.go) allowed 15/15 grid runs to green
# while the actual answers pointed at subExplorerEvaluator.Continuation-
# Prompt (the trivial `return "", false` in sub_explorer.go) instead of
# listing explorerEvaluator's real push strategies. See
# memory/project_df3_semantic_drift_2026_04_13.md.
#
# Tightened set, rationale per substring:
#   - ContinuationPrompt       entity name — always expected
#   - explorer.go              grounded in the right source file
#   - explorerEvaluator        disambiguates from subExplorerEvaluator
#                              so an answer pointing at sub_explorer.go
#                              no longer green-washes
# The two T3 ground-truth push strategies the answer must mention:
#   - partial                  the partial-read / function-boundary push
#   - enumeration              the enumeration-completeness push
# Both are short enough to appear in either Chinese or English answers
# (Chinese rewrite typically keeps the English term for "partial" and
# "enumeration").
EXPECT_CONTAINS="ContinuationPrompt explorer.go explorerEvaluator partial enumeration"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=""
